Package: fancyfx
Title: Flexible Effect Plots for Statistical Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Camille", "Ross", email = "camille.ross@maine.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1428-2294"))
Description: Plots the effect of a predictor with a rug of the raw data stacked
    directly above it, so a bend in the curve can be read against how much data
    supports it. Works across model types: generalized additive models fitted
    with 'mgcv' are shown as partial effects via 'gratia', and other models are
    shown as predictions via 'marginaleffects'. Provides control over individual
    terms, several rug styles, variable transformations, and multi-panel layouts.
